---
import MakerLayout from '../layouts/MakerLayout.astro';
const tools=[['🎟','Bingo Card Generator','Make printable or on-screen bingo cards from your own words, names or prompts.','/bingo-card-generator/'],['🔎','Word Search Generator','Turn a custom word list into a clean printable puzzle.','/word-search-generator/'],['👥','Random Team Generator','Split any list into fair random groups instantly.','/random-team-generator/'],['🎡','Decision Wheel','Spin custom choices and let chance make the call.','/decision-wheel/'],['🏆','Tournament Bracket','Create a knockout bracket for games, classrooms and events.','/tournament-bracket-generator/'],['🎫','Raffle Ticket Maker','Generate numbered printable raffle tickets without accounts.','/raffle-ticket-generator/'],['🪑','Seating Chart Maker','Arrange names into rows and columns for classes or events.','/seating-chart-generator/'],['🏅','Certificate Maker','Create a simple printable certificate in your browser.','/certificate-maker/']];
---
<MakerLayout title="PARADOX Makers — Free Printable & Random Generators" description="Free browser generators for bingo cards, word searches, random teams, decision wheels, brackets, raffle tickets, seating charts and certificates. No account required.">
<main class="maker-main">
<section class="maker-hero"><div><div class="maker-kicker">FREE GENERATORS · NO ACCOUNT</div><h1>Make the thing.<br><em>Print it. Share it.</em></h1><p>Useful little generators for classrooms, parties, teams, events, games and everyday life. Create something in seconds, then move on.</p><div class="maker-actions"><a class="maker-primary" href="#tools">Explore generators ↓</a><a class="maker-secondary" href="#why">Why it is free</a></div></div><div class="maker-stamp"><div class="maker-stamp-inner"><span>PARADOX</span><strong>MAKE<br/>IT.</strong><small>CLASSROOM · PARTY · WORK · LIFE</small></div></div></section>
<section class="maker-section"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">MOST USEFUL</div><h2>Start with a problem,<br/>not a menu.</h2></div><p>Search should take someone directly to the thing they need. These generators are built to finish the job quickly.</p></div><div class="maker-guides"><a class="maker-guide" href="/bingo-card-generator/">Make a custom bingo card →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/word-search-generator/">Create a printable word search →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/random-team-generator/">Split a group randomly →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/decision-wheel/">Let a wheel decide →</a></div></section>
<section class="maker-section" id="tools"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">GENERATOR STUDIO</div><h2>Useful little<br/><em>machines.</em></h2></div><p>Every page has a real generator, clear instructions, printable output and original supporting content.</p></div><div class="maker-tools">{tools.map(([icon,name,desc,href],i)=><a class:list={['maker-card',i===0&&'featured']} href={href}><div class="maker-icon">{icon}</div><div><h2>{name}</h2><p>{desc}</p></div><div class="maker-open">Open generator ↗</div></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="maker-section" id="guides"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">FREE GUIDES</div><h2>Useful beyond<br/>the button.</h2></div><p>Original guides give each search landing page depth and help people use the generated output well.</p></div><div class="maker-guides"><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/bingo-cards/">How to make a bingo card that is actually fun →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/word-searches/">How to build a readable word search →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/random-teams/">How to split a group fairly →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/printables/">How to print browser-made worksheets cleanly →</a></div></section>
<section class="maker-section" id="why"><div class="maker-why"><div class="maker-label">WHY PARADOX MAKERS</div><h2>Free means actually free.</h2><p>A visitor can arrive from search, solve one specific problem, print or save the result, and leave without creating an account.</p><p>Generation happens locally in the browser, so the core experience does not require paid APIs, upload infrastructure or a subscription.</p><p>The business model is simple: keep the tools accessible and monetize legitimate traffic with clearly separated advertising.</p></div></section>
</main>
</MakerLayout>
